OL,3,AReform's #72m donations 'entirely in
OL,4,Aline with law', Jenrick says
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's Robert Jenrick faces
OL,7,Fquestions from Laura Kuenssberg after
OL,8,Fthe party received two record-breaking
OL,9,Fdonations of #36m
OL,11,FJenrick says the donations are
OL,12,F"entirely in line with the law" as it
OL,13,Fstands, adding that it will allow the
OL,14,Fparty to be "battle ready" in the event
OL,15,Fof an early election
OL,17,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner is also
OL,18,Fquizzed by Kuenssberg over whether
OL,19,FLabour would have taken the donations
OL,20,Ffrom crypto billionaires
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
